102:#  rowed'.  BOTH ARE MEASURED FALSE (closing pass 5, artifacts/lcaisalane/opus_c5_20260915/OPUS_ANSWER.md). ***
103:#  THE CLASS IS EIGHT CELLS, DERIVED FROM THE HANDLER: it emits exactly ONE 1-byte bus forward per access, and the
104:#  one-edit perturbations of that one-element sequence are DROP (length 0), SWAP (length 1, direction flipped),
105:#  DUPLICATE (length 2, same direction) and ADD-OTHER (length 2, mixed), over TWO arms.  The two named above are the
106:#  write arm's ADD-OTHER and the read arm's DUPLICATE.  The write arm's DUPLICATE escapes at the tails and at len 6
