1140:#  ---- SESSIONS 5-10: the six cells that ENDED THE HOST on HEAD, one process each -------------
1141:#  Each cell gets its own process and its own `alive' row, so a reinstated exit is attributed to its
1142:#  cell -- with ONE overlap (codex, pass 2): w13's round trip ALSO reads (1,3), so an exit keyed on the
