  74: #  tail cells since closing pass 2; pass 2 and closing pass 1 found the same class --
  75: #  a (len, lane, direction) cell of the position rule with no row -- one cell over each time, so the
  76: #  repair rows the cross rather than the next cell): direct widths len 1, 2, 4, 8 x lane 0-3 x R/W,
  77: #  every cell rowed (the read side of len 4 at lanes 2/3 FULL-register, not only a single-lane mask);
  78: #  split HEADS len 1-7 at lane 3 x R/W (a head ends at a port 0x1f mod 0x20; this probe's is 0x3ff);
